  "whatsapp_greeting": "\ud83c\udfac Welcome to the @Fruitful@ Video Script Studio! I'm your AI cinematic director. Upload brand logos, product photos, and color palettes in the Asset Library first \u2014 then tell me your vision and I'll weave your actual brand assets directly into a world-class Pixar-level script. Or just say 'Generate a 60-second launch video' to start! \ud83c\udf0d\u2728",
